OL,3,GNEWSAThe cat crisis threatening to
OL,4,Aoverwhelm Birmingham's rescuers
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrom boxes of kittens abandoned by the
OL,7,Froadside to colonies of feral cats
OL,8,Fbreeding in alleyways and back gardens,
OL,9,Frescue teams across Birmingham say they
OL,10,Fare facing an unprecedented crisis.
OL,12,FAt centres across the city and beyond,
OL,13,Fvolunteers describe full shelters,
OL,14,Foverflowing waiting lists and the
OL,15,Fheartbreak of turning away animals they
OL,16,Fsimply do not have space for.
OL,18,F"At the moment, we're absolutely full,"
OL,19,Fsaid Vicki Rhind, who runs Happy Paws
OL,20,FCat Rescue in Tyseley.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
